{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38624","headline":"赵氏北楼 · 陆翱","name":"赵氏北楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"殷懃赵公子，良夜竟相留。\n朗月生东海，仙娥在北楼。\n酒阑珠露滴，歌逈石城秋。\n本爲愁人设，愁人到晓愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆翱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38624.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38624","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}